{"3669600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Service Please", "steam_appid": 3669600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Service Please </strong>is an immersive management and development simulation that follows your journey from a small startup to a massive restaurant empire. Every day, larger crowds of customers walk through your doors, your menu expands, and the workflow grows more complex—all shaped by the decisions you make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your business, expand your menu, manage your staff, and make the right strategic moves at the right time throughout your growth journey. Success is in your hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/c0b8b1fd43e40fd3dd4bee5acf21ca4c.poster.avif?t=1772819783\" width=940 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/c0b8b1fd43e40fd3dd4bee5acf21ca4c.webm?t=1772819783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/c0b8b1fd43e40fd3dd4bee5acf21ca4c.mp4?t=1772819783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/2c14f85781bb408ee0f04d119c82a0fd.poster.avif?t=1772819783\" width=800 height=50 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/2c14f85781bb408ee0f04d119c82a0fd.webm?t=1772819783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/2c14f85781bb408ee0f04d119c82a0fd.mp4?t=1772819783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Design Your Own Business</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your establishment exactly how you want it with tables, chairs, decorative touches, and a layout that is entirely your own.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create stylish service areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase customer interest through aesthetic design.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boost efficiency by upgrading kitchen equipment.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The identity of your restaurant is the first impression that lingers in your customers' minds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/400140eedb13c4c2b087921d2754235f.poster.avif?t=1772819783\" width=940 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/400140eedb13c4c2b087921d2754235f.webm?t=1772819783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/400140eedb13c4c2b087921d2754235f.mp4?t=1772819783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/b591d5b4a305304cb54493f42c400b36.webp?t=1772819783\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand Your Menu and Impress Customers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reflect your style with a wide range of food and beverages.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract more customers by enriching your menu.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add unique touches to alcoholic beverages and coffee varieties.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every new product increases the prestige of your restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/c259b9a21331f69594f61bd6552a6641.poster.avif?t=1772819783\" width=940 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/c259b9a21331f69594f61bd6552a6641.webm?t=1772819783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/c259b9a21331f69594f61bd6552a6641.mp4?t=1772819783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/62c0407db496e08df39423eeabe48521.webp?t=1772819783\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Manage Your Staff, Boost Performance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Employees are the heart of a restaurant. The right team means fast and flawless service.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up employees to increase speed and quality.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize task distribution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan your stocks carefully; never leave a demand unmet.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create a more efficient service flow every day through effective management.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/f933b7a7c441e283bfa2971712461a67.poster.avif?t=1772819783\" width=940 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/f933b7a7c441e283bfa2971712461a67.webm?t=1772819783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/f933b7a7c441e283bfa2971712461a67.mp4?t=1772819783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/d160dd99d91bc46b37d8c76b1fe37326.webp?t=1772819783\" width=800 height=60 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape Your Progress with Task and Skills</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just about serving food; it's about taking responsibility for an ever-growing business.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to earn new rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the features you want in the skill tree.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your management style as you wish.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision determines the future of your restaurant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/ac17272ed1b61da2f89fcb97db36b334.poster.avif?t=1772819783\" width=940 height=528 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/ac17272ed1b61da2f89fcb97db36b334.webm?t=1772819783\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/extras/ac17272ed1b61da2f89fcb97db36b334.mp4?t=1772819783\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669600/ex